<title>FRANCE: Rouen Sept 1-25 flour exports at 36,947 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Sept 1-25 flour exports at 36,947 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen totalled 36,947 tonnes from September 1 to September 25, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Some 14,623 tonnes of flour were destined for west Africa, 20,574 tonnes for Egypt and 1,750 tonnes for Latvia, they said.</p>
<p>Flour exports in September 1995 totalled 52,000 tonnes . --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
